{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30194","headline":"和元常侍除浙东留题 · 路贯","name":"和元常侍除浙东留题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢安致理逾三载，黄霸清声彻九重。\n犹辍佩环归凤阙，且将仁政到稽峯。\n林间立马罗千骑，池上开筵醉一锺。\n共喜甘棠有新咏，独惭霜鬓又攀龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"路贯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}